39,2,1,talk,Toshio,,The closeout files confirm my suspicion. Catalogue projects last; mechanism ones stall.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Toshio, that is a sobering truth. We must value sustainability over novelty.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
