47,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The animal facility accreditation is good, but the cost is a barrier.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The schedule overruns for breeding colonies are a red flag for amphibian work.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I will weigh the long-term utility against the immediate scientific promise.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,Let us consider who can actually execute the work with the resources we have.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,I feel the grant is more valuable for computational and field-based work now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"The shared infrastructure is fragile, but the computing support is robust.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
